{"id":"2362242567","kind":"answer","title":"滴答清单新更新的艾宾浩斯记忆法重复规则怎么利用？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"间隔重复 & 注意力管理","date":"2022-02-24","updated":"2022-02-24","votes":82,"comment_count":19,"minutes":3,"chars":1652,"keywords":["间隔重复","助记媒介","注意力管理","SRS","记忆系统"],"summary":"艾宾浩斯记忆法这么一个杜撰的东西，居然 @滴答清单 还能一起传谣。 但凡去看看艾宾浩斯的原著，或者艾宾浩斯的 wikipedia 页面，也不至于把这玩意当真。 Classics in the History of Psychology 艾宾浩斯的遗忘曲线是真的，他的数据有归档记录： 但这只是他测试的几个复习时间点，和是否是合适…","question_detail_html":"<p>新更新的软件新加入了一个艾宾浩斯记忆法的重复规则，但是毕竟这是个清单app，不是像其他学习app一样直接和记忆法的结合，很好奇要怎么才能把这个功能充分利用起来？</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/378740835/answer/2362242567","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"W_vyStds\"> 艾宾浩斯记忆法这么一个杜撰的东西，居然 <a class=\"member_mention\" data-hash=\"f3f2ea12baa4410b24caecc4d45422a1\" data-hovercard=\"p$b$f3f2ea12baa4410b24caecc4d45422a1\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/people/f3f2ea12baa4410b24caecc4d45422a1\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">@滴答清单</a> 还能一起传谣。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-839623cf1f417d76e289f1435d4e1110_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-cbfc5108a772ad8077c26bf82451edfa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-cbfc5108a772ad8077c26bf82451edfa_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"849\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-839623cf1f417d76e289f1435d4e1110_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-cbfc5108a772ad8077c26bf82451edfa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-cbfc5108a772ad8077c26bf82451edfa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"849\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"HV5kUVEd\">但凡去看看艾宾浩斯的原著，或者艾宾浩斯的 wikipedia 页面，也不至于把这玩意当真。</p><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://psychclassics.yorku.ca/Ebbinghaus/index.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Classics in the History of Psychology</a><p data-pid=\"cy130DNm\">艾宾浩斯的遗忘曲线是真的，他的数据有归档记录：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-929d42205a2d2cad0316e6a8f664de48_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-6088701ff8f145c8c4811a6c938015b0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6088701ff8f145c8c4811a6c938015b0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"416\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-929d42205a2d2cad0316e6a8f664de48_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-6088701ff8f145c8c4811a6c938015b0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6088701ff8f145c8c4811a6c938015b0_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"416\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"woIt1GKu\">但这只是他测试的几个复习时间点，和是否是合适的记忆时间半毛钱关系都没有。</p><p data-pid=\"c0g3-Ax_\">另外这表上的时间是 20 分钟、1 小时、8.8 小时、1 天、2 天、6 天、31 天，和滴答清单上的 1 2 4 7 15 也完全对不上。</p><p data-pid=\"A3ML6XjI\">历史上有给出复习时间表的研究者也不少，比如 C.A. Mace 在 1932 年 <i>Psychology of study</i> 一书中提出了 1 天、2 天、4 天、8 天的复习间隔：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8471f8a819c491af0d4626467d10c0e8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e4e29163a3c916044126a0e05c1d110b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e4e29163a3c916044126a0e05c1d110b_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"897\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-8471f8a819c491af0d4626467d10c0e8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-e4e29163a3c916044126a0e05c1d110b\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e4e29163a3c916044126a0e05c1d110b_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"897\"/><figcaption>https://archive.org/details/psychologyofstud00mace/page/38/mode/2up</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"cF2HbV5v\">还有 Paul Pimsleur 在 1967 年的论文 A Memory Schedule 中提出了 5 秒、25 秒、2 分钟、10 分钟、1 小时、5 小时、1 天、 5 天、25 天、4 个月和 2 年的间隔：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e2a38366019c4a346b28344e30158b9f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b5027f7b553379b60a3460bf998c8036\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b5027f7b553379b60a3460bf998c8036_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1190\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-e2a38366019c4a346b28344e30158b9f_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b5027f7b553379b60a3460bf998c8036\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b5027f7b553379b60a3460bf998c8036_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1190\"/><figcaption>https://onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/10.1111/j.1540-4781.1967.tb06700.x</figcaption></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-177f27659a93a8840ca9998ccbd551d3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b79fdb7b5951bc2898920b574f413f91\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-b79fdb7b5951bc2898920b574f413f91_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1212\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-177f27659a93a8840ca9998ccbd551d3_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-b79fdb7b5951bc2898920b574f413f91\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-b79fdb7b5951bc2898920b574f413f91_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1212\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"Dxi0pkSg\">至于这些时间表是否是合理的，我只能说记忆的遗忘速度和记忆的材料有很大的关系。这些研究所采用的材料不尽相同，所以得出了不同的时间表也是很正常的。墨墨背单词也有自己的一套复习间隔（1 天、3 天、5 天、7 天……）：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-5bd22e13b39ddedaf5798a156fa81782_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-7e81f09ae09ff6c2afdbaa23a2651e15\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-7e81f09ae09ff6c2afdbaa23a2651e15_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-5bd22e13b39ddedaf5798a156fa81782_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-7e81f09ae09ff6c2afdbaa23a2651e15\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7e81f09ae09ff6c2afdbaa23a2651e15_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/><figcaption>https://www.zhihu.com/question/19798259/answer/2125871191</figcaption></figure><p data-pid=\"cisTpv2x\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://andymatuschak.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Andy Matuschak</a> 和 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://michaelnielsen.org/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Michael Nielsen</a> 的《<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://quantum.country/qcvc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">量子国度</a>》的间隔为当天、1 月、3 月（很夸张吧？但是 Andy 公开的数据表明有一半的读者在 1 个月后回忆率在 85% 以上）</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"content_image\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4b0f609dffaa3b16d88872bd47828356_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-29e904c32f57e118119852823fb19bf8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-29e904c32f57e118119852823fb19bf8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"307\"/></noscript><img class=\"content_image lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-4b0f609dffaa3b16d88872bd47828356_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-29e904c32f57e118119852823fb19bf8\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-29e904c32f57e118119852823fb19bf8_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"307\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"w6qZ5rxv\">所以，没有普遍适用的安排表，真要对不同材料给出相应的复习安排，还是得需要相关的算法支持，比如 Anki 使用的 SM-2 算法：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e643fda650b01e35c7f70fbbd997dacc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a06471b1344b96988fc460e7d2921d15\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-a06471b1344b96988fc460e7d2921d15_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"693\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e643fda650b01e35c7f70fbbd997dacc_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-a06471b1344b96988fc460e7d2921d15\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-a06471b1344b96988fc460e7d2921d15_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"693\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"XwPe9Hhw\">不过这个算法是 Wozniak 在 1987 年开发的，虽然现在很流行，但也很落后了。SuperMemo 的算法已经发展到 SM-18 了。最近几年也有挺多间隔重复结合机器学习的论文在研究新算法，我最近投   KDD 的论文也是做这个方向的，可以期待一下。</p><p data-pid=\"kDZHq5CF\">最后为了避免偏题，我回答一下怎么把这个功能用起来：</p><p data-pid=\"7kp3vqj4\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4bR1HVvDUhMXDm5SJB4Tiw4xGbrm9AfXWgbc\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统让记忆成为一种选择</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>，但交由计算机处理时间安排的价值，更在于动态地安排和选择要复习的问题。从某种意义上说，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z4eXdSMJFv2qVGXSUEKH4vdcHBrLHcFY1ZGfC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复记忆系统</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>的功效来自于它<b>编程注意力</b>的能力（<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/zJrfPCbY7GcpV9asEc8NTVzXTAV4TvRFMuY6\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">可编程的注意力</a>）。不如把它想成「大脑的{cron}」（注：cron 是类 Unix 操作系统下的定期任务管理系统。）</p><p data-pid=\"zPygJsJ5\">间隔重复的核心理念——根据一定的时间表自动安排任务，并适时展示——可以在很多软件和领域中应用。我把这个概念叫做 <a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z59aJSjgqr4B1k1ofoE7ZBF2dv8MeJ1Drf4TQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔一切</a>。</p><p data-pid=\"jA2dCvWx\">一些例子：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"jy7P9Miu\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2gZooHVxB8x6EbDSR97Bz1jFMqAqSWSLPnMs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">渐进阅读</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"SR15LwNu\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z73hGbYFm7bjV3yYwK29MvbBZEcwK6kWyduqV\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">穿越时间的文本</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"RyxpV5YY\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7iCjRziX6V6unNWL81yc2dJicpRw2Cpp9MfQ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复对于逐步完善灵光一闪可能有用</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup></li><li data-pid=\"2-ufwyed\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z7yRMBXGc81KkUwLxefodzfnnfKXx63vXzP88\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">间隔重复可以降低破坏性收件箱维护操作的风险</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>（待办事项清单、电子邮件、阅读清单等）</li><li data-pid=\"LISMn0CG\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://notes.andymatuschak.org/z2ewMN8Hzd8gt4qyfQV1ognJ5PQs3CXxDfCJ\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Readwise</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup></li></ul><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-image=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/v2-9e99f5394e9d06b243179d057d6dafe3_120x160.jpg\" data-image-height=\"1190\" data-image-width=\"850\" data-tm-id=\"414293765\" href=\"#/post/414293765\">叶峻峣：【翻译】可使用间隔重复系统对注意力编程</a><p data-pid=\"J5reTwx_\">希望对题主有所帮助。</p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统使记忆成为一种选择 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"397582470\" href=\"#/post/397582470\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 间隔重复记忆系统 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"404257681\" href=\"#/post/404257681\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 同时阅读上百篇文章？渐进阅读之程序员视角(IRAPP) <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/307996163\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/307996163</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 穿越时间的文本 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"395283887\" href=\"#/post/395283887\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 间隔重复对于逐步完善灵光一闪可能有用 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"415857130\" href=\"#/post/415857130\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 间隔重复可以降低对收件箱进行维护中破坏性操作风险 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"438631838\" href=\"#/post/438631838\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> Readwise <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"449726755\" href=\"#/post/449726755\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"404257681","title":"间隔重复记忆系统（Spaced repetition memory system）","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":88,"minutes":16,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"395283887","title":"穿越时间的文本","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":30,"minutes":8,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"415857130","title":"间隔重复对于逐步完善灵光一闪可能有用","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":29,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"449726755","title":"Readwise","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":22,"minutes":4,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"397582470","title":"间隔重复记忆系统使记忆成为一种选择","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":19,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"438631838","title":"间隔重复可以降低对收件箱进行维护中破坏性操作风险","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":14,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"414293765","title":"可使用间隔重复系统对注意力编程","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":24,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"409427537","title":"操作系统层级的间隔重复系统","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":13,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"720345834","title":"你应该记住什么？间隔重复你的生活","author":"Jose Luis Ricon","votes":65,"minutes":4,"reason":"延伸深读 · Jose Luis Ricon"},{"id":"649704369","title":"叶峻峣, 苏敬勇, 曹译珑. 优化间隔重复调度的一种随机最短路径算法[C]//第 28 届 ACM SIGKDD 知识发现与数据挖掘学术会议论文集, 2022: 4381-4390","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":18,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"},{"id":"470710559","title":"间隔重复系统中选择去记忆某项内容的行为有如轻松的手势","author":"Andy Matuschak","votes":15,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Andy Matuschak"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2680582773","title":"怎样提高自己的记忆能力？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":815,"minutes":3,"reason":"相似问答 · 815 赞同"},{"id":"2016796179850085860","title":"如何在一到两年之内成为某个领域的专家？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":2617,"minutes":24,"reason":"相似问答 · 2617 赞同"},{"id":"3456061351","title":"理论上人的大脑可以记忆多少东西？","author":"Jarrett Ye","votes":134,"minutes":4,"reason":"相似问答 · 134 赞同"},{"id":"1950988300912424439","title":"大学生不喜欢上课的真正原因是什么？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":570,"minutes":11,"reason":"相似问答 · 570 赞同"},{"id":"2998286352","title":"想形成长期记忆，或者永久记忆，需要重复记忆多少天并且多少遍呀？